      "content": "That's helpful. I was a little worried about the Marcus and Andre descriptions being too \"on the nose.\" \n\nWhen you say they fit the crime drama vibe better, are you saying it's because of their backgrounds/personalities, or is there something about how they're written that just feels more naturally \"urban\" or \"street\" compared to someone like Julian? Just trying to see if I'm accidentally leaning too hard into racialized settings.",
